= 1928

  And the new year begins with the dreams and hopes of the german nation. As the german right has cannibalized itself to the point of no return, social democrats have ascended to the prominence and if we are to be lucky, we will likely enter the next government. 

  Our agenda for this year, if we are to enter the government, is: 

  • Expansion of workers' rights, laws and workplace safety.

  • Protection and expansion of welfare program.

  • Foreign reparations reconciliation.

  • Democratization of the institutes and reformation of the justiciary system.

  • Socialization of the economy.

  • Expansion of women rights and some even suggest fighting back against criminalization of homosexual behavior.

  • And the list goes on, accordingly to Heidelberg Programme of 1926.

  ---

  Though it's quite early to judge, it seems like something is brewing up on the rural countryside. It is very possible it was caused by the absence of estate agriculture protection and market being flooded by imported productions, causing sharp drop of costs all around.

  Despite it being huge thorn on right's side, it does not look like something exploitable by us.

@april

= The New World

 Could it happen due to some intervention from the future, who merely thinks Ebert was right for all his faults...?

 The world's storybook begins with the collapse of National Socialist Freedom Movement. DAP has fallen into heavy infighting and soon under Drexler it collapsed without gaining any sort of momentum, nor help of critical member...

 With the turn towards moderate nationalism, DNVP has alienated it's volkisch and national conservative elements, defecting to the DVFP, giving it strength it has never dreamth of. 

 What will future envision for us?

 Perhaps, will world be shaped far differently than other world was shaped by it's future future, which intervened to this situation with it's almighty confidence?
